<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALY AND ENGLAND DRAW 1-1 IN UNDER-21 FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALY AND ENGLAND DRAW 1-1 IN UNDER-21 FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>GENOA, Italy 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a friendly match played on Wednesday between the under-21 sides of Italy's Serie B and England's first division:</p>
<p>Italy 1 England 1 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>    Italy   - Pirri 35</p>
<p>England - Newton 62</p>
<p>Attendance: 200</p>
</text>
